\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. In our work and in our play,
\par Jesus, ever with us stay;
\par May we always strive to be
\par True and faithful unto Thee.
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par \'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Then we truthfully can sing:
\par We are children of the King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. May we in Thy strength subdue
\par Evil tempers, words untrue,
\par Thoughts impure and deeds unkind.
\par All things hateful to Thy mind.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Then we truthfully can sing:
\par We are children of the King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus, from Thy throne above
\par Deign to fill us with Thy love,
\par So that all arround may see
\par We belong, dear Lord, to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Then we truthfully can sing:
\par We are children of the King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Children of the king are we,
\par May we loyal to Him be;
\par Try to please Him every day,
\par In our work and in our play.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Then we truthfully can sing:
\par We are children of the King.
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par \f1 
